---
// Reading benchstat statistical significance + the 3 Benchmarking Levels (Micro, Macro e2e/k6, Canary Production).
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="ge6d">
  <div class="ge6d-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="How benchstat separates real allocation wins (p = 0.002) from noisy laptop variance (tilde p = 0.240) on the left, paired with Micro, Macro, and Production benchmarking levels on the right.">
      {/* Left: benchstat verdict */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="430" height="260" rx="10" class="ge6d-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="ge6d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Reading benchstat (n=6..10 runs, p &lt; 0.05)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Đọc kết quả benchstat (lặp -count=6..10, p &lt; 0.05)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="398" height="62" rx="6" class="ge6d-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="82" class="ge6d-b-red">sec/op: 1.80m ± 69%  vs  2.09m ± 48%   ~ (p=0.240)</text>
      <text x="44" y="102" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>High variance + p &gt; 0.05 → "~" means DO NOT claim speedup yet</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Biến động ±69% &amp; p &gt; 0.05 → "~" tức chưa đủ tin cậy để kết luận!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="134" width="398" height="62" rx="6" class="ge6d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="156" class="ge6d-b-ok">B/op: 1,401,264 ± 0% vs 216 ± 0%  -99.98% (p=0.002)</text>
      <text x="44" y="176" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Zero noise + p = 0.002 → proven 99.98% heap allocation cut!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Sai số 0% &amp; p = 0.002 → chắc chắn giảm được 99,98% RAM heap!</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="208" width="398" height="50" rx="6" class="ge6d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="229" class="ge6d-b">Reduce variance before comparing:</text>
      <text x="44" y="246" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Close heavy apps, pin -cpu=4, use -benchtime=2s, save git SHAs</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tắt app nặng, cố định -cpu=4, tăng -benchtime để giảm nhiễu</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Benchmarking Pyramid / 3 levels */}
      <rect x="462" y="14" width="424" height="260" rx="10" class="ge6d-card" />
      <text x="478" y="42" class="ge6d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Match test scope to benchmarking level</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Ba cấp độ đo kiểm hiệu năng (Micro → Macro → Prod)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="478" y="60" width="392" height="58" rx="6" class="ge6d-box" />
      <text x="492" y="80" class="ge6d-b">Microbenchmark (testing.B — like Unit Tests)</text>
      <text x="492" y="98" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tests 1 function in seconds; blind to network, GC pauses &amp; K8s.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đo lẻ 1 hàm cực nhanh; không thấy được lỗi mạng hay GC tổng thể.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="478" y="130" width="392" height="62" rx="6" class="ge6d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="492" y="150" class="ge6d-b-ok">Macrobenchmark (Go e2e containers + k6 load)</text>
      <text x="492" y="168" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Spins real Go binary + Prometheus/DB + k6 users inside Docker;</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chạy cả binary thật + DB/Prometheus + k6 trong container;</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="492" y="184" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>catches connection churn, pooling overhead &amp; OOM spikes.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>bắt trọn các lỗi connection pool, sync.Pool hay OOM lúc tải thật.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="478" y="204" width="392" height="54" rx="6" class="ge6d-box is-red" />
      <text x="492" y="224" class="ge6d-b-red">Production Canary / Shadow Replay</text>
      <text x="492" y="242" class="ge6d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Highest realism on 1–5% live traffic; lowest repeatability.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thực tế nhất trên 1–5% tải thật, nhưng khó lặp lại điều kiện y hệt.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Never ship a refactor on one noisy benchmark run: let benchstat check statistical significance (p &lt; 0.05), then validate system-level memory and p99 latency with a containerized e2e macrobenchmark.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đừng dựa vào một lần chạy benchmark đầy nhiễu: hãy để benchstat kiểm tra độ tin cậy thống kê (p &lt; 0.05), rồi kiểm chứng lại trên toàn hệ thống bằng macrobenchmark trong container.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge6d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge6d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge6d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge6d text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge6d-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge6d-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge6d-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge6d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6d-h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge6d-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge6d-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge6d-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge6d-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge6d-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge6d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
